  "format": "GF Trinity encrypted UTF-16 message DAT",
  "initialKey": 0,
  "messages": [
    {
      "displayText": "Oh, que voilà un<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿĀe Dresseu<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿȁrse puissant<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿĀe !\nSeriez-vous intéressé<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿĀe par de beaux Poireaux ?<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕǔ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 10,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 0,
      "offsetInSection": 428,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 112
    },
    {
      "displayText": "D’ailleurs, connaissez-vous une espèce du nom\nde Canarticho ?<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕǔ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 1,
      "offsetInSection": 652,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0044201900610069006C006C0065007500720073002C00200063006F006E006E00610069007300730065007A002D0076006F0075007300200075006E0065002000650073007000E8006300650020006400750020006E006F006D000A00640065002000430061006E006100720074006900630068006F0020003F00100002011401D40000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 66
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Ces Pokémon se promènent toujours avec un gros\nlégume, et s’en servent parfois comme arme.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕǔ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 2,
      "offsetInSection": 784,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 95
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Eh bien, j’ai entendu des rumeurs étranges\nimpliquant des Canarticho et leur Poireau...<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕǔ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 3,
      "offsetInSection": 976,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 92
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Il paraît qu’un criminel sévit la nuit, à un endroit\nspécifique...<U+0010><U+0001>븁\nIl n’attaquerait que les gens accompagnés\nd’un Canarticho tenant un Poireau !<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕǔ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 4,
      "offsetInSection": 1160,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 152
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Quelqu’un de puissant<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿĀe comme vous pourrait\npeut-être vaincre ce criminel ?<U+0010><U+0001>븁\nTenez, je vous donne même un Poireau\npour tenter d’éclaircir cette histoire.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕǔ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 6,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 5,
      "offsetInSection": 1464,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 164
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Le criminel s’attaque aux gens accompagnés\nd’<U+0010><U+0002>＀<U+0006>un seul Canarticho<U+0010><U+0002>＀<U+0000> tenant un <U+0010><U+0002>＀<U+0006>Poireau<U+0010><U+0002>＀<U+0000>.<U+0010><U+0001>븁\nIl rôde la <U+0010><U+0002>＀<U+0006>nuit<U+0010><U+0002>＀<U+0000> dans le <U+0010><U+0002>＀<U+0006>7ᵉ arrondissement\nde Maurouge<U+0010><U+0002>＀<U+0000>.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕǔ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 28,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 6,
      "offsetInSection": 1792,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 177
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+0007>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 7,
      "offsetInSection": 2148,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00070000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Vous vous remémorez les instructions spécifiques\nde la mission...<U+0010><U+0001>븁\n« Le criminel s’attaque aux gens accompagnés\nd’<U+0010><U+0002>＀<U+0006>un seul Canarticho<U+0010><U+0002>＀<U+0000> tenant un <U+0010><U+0002>＀<U+0006>Poireau<U+0010><U+0002>＀<U+0000>. »<U+0010><U+0001>븁\n« Il rôde la <U+0010><U+0002>＀<U+0006>nuit<U+0010><U+0002>＀<U+0000> dans le <U+0010><U+0002>＀<U+0006>7ᵉ arrondissement\nde Maurouge<U+0010><U+0002>＀<U+0000>. »",
      "escapedControlUnits": 28,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 8,
      "offsetInSection": 2160,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 250
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Ce Poireau... Il est superbe !\nJe vous défie en combat avec mon Canarticho !<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǕ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 9,
      "offsetInSection": 2660,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 81
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Mais... Ce légume énorme...\nC’est... c’est un Canarticho de Galar !!!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǕ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 10,
      "offsetInSection": 2824,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004D006100690073002E002E002E0020004300650020006C00E900670075006D0065002000E9006E006F0072006D0065002E002E002E000A00432019006500730074002E002E002E00200063201900650073007400200075006E002000430061006E006100720074006900630068006F002000640065002000470061006C00610072002000210021002100100002011401D50000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 74
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Canaaar !",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 11,
      "offsetInSection": 2972,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00430061006E0061006100610072002000210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 10
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Tichooo !",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 12,
      "offsetInSection": 2992,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0054006900630068006F006F006F002000210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 10
    },
    {
      "displayText": "En garde !<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǕ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 13,
      "offsetInSection": 3012,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0045006E0020006700610072006400650020002100100002011401D50000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 15
    },
    {
      "displayText": "À propos...<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕǔ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 14,
      "offsetInSection": 3044,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00C0002000700072006F0070006F0073002E002E002E00100002011401D40000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 16
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+000F>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 15,
      "offsetInSection": 3076,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF000F0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "J’accepte ma défaite !<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǕ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 16,
      "offsetInSection": 3088,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004A201900610063006300650070007400650020006D00610020006400E9006600610069007400650020002100100002011401D50000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 27
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Vous n’avez pas frémi devant mon attaque, et\nvos coups de Poireau étaient précis et sans pitié...<U+0010><U+0001>븀\nVous devez être un<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿĀe Dresseu<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿȁrse de haut renom.<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǕ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 8,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 17,
      "offsetInSection": 3144,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 161
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Réussir à le vaincre ainsi...\nVotre coup de Poireau est redoutable !<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǓ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 18,
      "offsetInSection": 3468,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "005200E900750073007300690072002000E00020006C00650020007600610069006E006300720065002000610069006E00730069002E002E002E000A0056006F00740072006500200063006F0075007000200064006500200050006F0069007200650061007500200065007300740020007200650064006F0075007400610062006C00650020002100100002011401D30000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 73
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Je désire, moi aussi, livrer un combat sans merci\ncontre vous !<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǓ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 19,
      "offsetInSection": 3616,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004A00650020006400E90073006900720065002C0020006D006F0069002000610075007300730069002C0020006C0069007600720065007200200075006E00200063006F006D006200610074002000730061006E00730020006D0065007200630069000A0063006F006E00740072006500200076006F007500730020002100100002011401D30000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 68
    },
    {
      "displayText": "La défaite de mon compagnon est aussi\nma défaite. Je dois laver ce déshonneur.<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǓ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 20,
      "offsetInSection": 3752,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 83
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Ouaaah, mais non ?! Un Canarticho de Galar ?!<U+0010><U+0001>븁\nHum... Peu m’importe ! La voie du guerrier\nm’impose de combattre ici et maintenant !<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǓ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 21,
      "offsetInSection": 3920,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 138
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Canaaar !",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 22,
      "offsetInSection": 4196,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00430061006E0061006100610072002000210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 10
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Tichooo !",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 23,
      "offsetInSection": 4216,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0054006900630068006F006F006F002000210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 10
    },
    {
      "displayText": "En garde !<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǓ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 24,
      "offsetInSection": 4236,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0045006E0020006700610072006400650020002100100002011401D30000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 15
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+0019>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 25,
      "offsetInSection": 4268,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00190000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Je suis vaincu !<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǓ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 26,
      "offsetInSection": 4280,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004A0065002000730075006900730020007600610069006E006300750020002100100002011401D30000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 21
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Quels enfers avez-vous dû braver avec\nce Canarticho pour obtenir une telle force ?<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǓ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 27,
      "offsetInSection": 4324,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 87
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Ainsi donc, mes deux camarades ont mordu\nla poussière...<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕǔ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 28,
      "offsetInSection": 4500,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00410069006E0073006900200064006F006E0063002C0020006D0065007300200064006500750078002000630061006D0061007200610064006500730020006F006E00740020006D006F007200640075000A006C006100200070006F007500730073006900E800720065002E002E002E00100002011401D40000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 61
    },
    {
      "displayText": "L’honneur du Trio du Poireau a été terriblement\nbafoué cette nuit.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕǔ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 29,
      "offsetInSection": 4624,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004C20190068006F006E006E0065007500720020006400750020005400720069006F00200064007500200050006F0069007200650061007500200061002000E9007400E90020007400650072007200690062006C0065006D0065006E0074000A006200610066006F007500E90020006300650074007400650020006E007500690074002E00100002011401D40000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 71
    },
    {
      "displayText": "En réalité je suis Bushy, la plus puissante\nlame du Trio du Poireau.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕǔ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 30,
      "offsetInSection": 4768,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0045006E0020007200E90061006C0069007400E90020006A006500200073007500690073002000420075007300680079002C0020006C006100200070006C007500730020007000750069007300730061006E00740065000A006C0061006D00650020006400750020005400720069006F00200064007500200050006F00690072006500610075002E00100002011401D40000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 73
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Il est temps de vous faire une démonstration de\nla technique du Poireau de l’école de Kanto !<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕǔ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 31,
      "offsetInSection": 4916,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 98
    },
    {
      "displayText": "La technique du Poireau de l’école de Kanto\nfait frémir même les Canarticho de Galar !<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕǔ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 32,
      "offsetInSection": 5112,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 91
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Que le combat... commence !<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕǔ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 33,
      "offsetInSection": 5296,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0051007500650020006C006500200063006F006D006200610074002E002E002E00200063006F006D006D0065006E006300650020002100100002011401D40000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 32
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Canaaar !",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 34,
      "offsetInSection": 5360,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00430061006E0061006100610072002000210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 10
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Tichooo !",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 35,
      "offsetInSection": 5380,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0054006900630068006F006F006F002000210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 10
    },
    {
      "displayText": "En garde !<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕǔ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 36,
      "offsetInSection": 5400,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0045006E0020006700610072006400650020002100100002011401D40000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 15
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿%",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 37,
      "offsetInSection": 5432,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00250000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Impressionnant !<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕǔ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 38,
      "offsetInSection": 5444,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0049006D007000720065007300730069006F006E006E0061006E00740020002100100002011401D40000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 21
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Canar ! Cananar !",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 39,
      "offsetInSection": 5488,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00430061006E0061007200200021002000430061006E0061006E00610072002000210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 18
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Hé hé hé...<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕǔ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 40,
      "offsetInSection": 5524,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004800E90020006800E90020006800E9002E002E002E00100002011401D40000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 16
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Ah, quel beau combat !<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕǔ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 41,
      "offsetInSection": 5556,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00410068002C0020007100750065006C0020006200650061007500200063006F006D0062006100740020002100100002011401D40000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 27
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Veuillez nous pardonner ce guet-apens.<U+0010><U+0001>븁\nNous sommes cinéphiles, et nous adorons\ntout particulièrement « Le Trio du Poireau ».<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕǔ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 42,
      "offsetInSection": 5612,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 132
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Notre plus grand rêve était de recréer la scène\nla plus palpitante du film.<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǕ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 43,
      "offsetInSection": 5876,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 80
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Nous cherchions donc un Canarticho accompagné\nd’un<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿĀe Dresseu<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿȁrse assez fort<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿĀe pour nous affronter.<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǓ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 8,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 44,
      "offsetInSection": 6036,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 115
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Lorsque je vous ai vu<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿĀe, j’ai tout de suite su que\nvous étiez à la hauteur et je vous ai conduit<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿĀe ici !<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕǔ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 6,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 45,
      "offsetInSection": 6268,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 117
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Je voulais conserver la tension dramatique,\ndonc j’ai... disons... omis certains détails.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕǔ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 46,
      "offsetInSection": 6504,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 94
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Veuillez m’excuser pour cette petite mascarade...<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕǔ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 47,
      "offsetInSection": 6692,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0056006500750069006C006C0065007A0020006D2019006500780063007500730065007200200070006F0075007200200063006500740074006500200070006500740069007400650020006D00610073006300610072006100640065002E002E002E00100002011401D40000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 54
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Quoi qu’il en soit, merci du fond du cœur de vous\nêtre amusé<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿĀe avec nous !<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕǔ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 48,
      "offsetInSection": 6800,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 83
    },
    {
